    usage:panel('usage','Usage, without a cloud bill.','Actual token counts reported by the model. Local inference has no Forge subscription or per-token charge.',`<div id="usage-stats" class="stats-grid"></div><p class="feature-note">Hardware, power, downloaded models, and any separately configured remote service can have their own costs. Token statistics only include requests where the model reports usage.</p><button id="export-usage" class="secondary-button">Export usage CSV</button><div id="usage-list" class="feature-list"></div>`),
